<title>FRANCE: French housing starts fall in 3-mths to end Jan 97.</title>
<headline>French housing starts fall in 3-mths to end Jan 97.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French housing ministry gave the following unadjusted figures for January housing starts.</p>
<p>			     3-mths to end  12-mths to end</p>
<p>				  Jan 97	   Jan 97</p>
<p>HOUSING APPROVED</p>
<p> (total nos)		  77,200	  306,700</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		   4.9	     -0.9</p>
<p> STARTED			65,000	  269,700</p>
<p> (percent)			-7.8	     -5.2</p>
<p>NON-HOUSE BUILDING</p>
<p>APPROVED</p>
<p> (sq metres)		7.27 million	32.92 million</p>
<p> (y/y pct chg)		  -4.7	     -5.3</p>
<p> STARTED		    7.40 million	30.53 million</p>
<p> percent			  -7.2	     -2.9</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
